{
  "title": "创建权限",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div data-condition=\"Others:NewFor91\">\n  <h1>创建权限</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">您可以先创建权限，然后将其分配给 ItemType（物料类型），也可以直接在 ItemType 的\"权限\"（Permissions）选项卡中创建权限。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">要创建权限：</p>\n  <ol>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">在目录（TOC）中，选择 <strong>管理（Administration）-&gt;权限（Permissions）-&gt;创建新权限（Create New Permissions）</strong>。将出现以下窗口：</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/perm3.jpg\"></p>\n  <ol start=\"2\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">输入权限名称。通常名称应能描述正在创建的权限类型，或将要应用该权限的条目。</li>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">下一步是指定访问权限。访问设置在下表中描述。请注意，\"可添加权限\"（Can Add Permission）和\"目录访问权限\"（TOC Access Permission）不在权限条目中设置。这两项直接从 ItemType 中设置。请分别参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">可添加</a>和<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">目录访问</a>了解如何设置这些权限。</li>\n  </ol>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"margin-left: 54.75pt; vertical-align: top;\" width=\"80.2%\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 24.661%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 75.339%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tableheading\">权限（Privileges）</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-left: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tableheading\">说明（Definition）</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Get（获取）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许您检索/查看条目</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Update（更新）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许您编辑现有条目</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Delete（删除）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许您删除条目</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Can Discover（可发现）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许您了解条目是否存在。请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">发现权限</a></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Can Change Access（可更改访问权限）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许您更改已创建条目实例的访问设置</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Show Permission Warning（显示权限警告）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">与\"可发现\"（Can Discover）配合使用，决定当搜索结果中应返回不具有发现权限的条目时是否向用户显示警告。如果启用此设置，将显示警告；否则用户不会知道是否有条目因权限不足而缺失。</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">TOC Access（目录访问）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许用户通过目录（TOC，目录表）访问条目</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 30.14%; border: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-top: none; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Can Add（可添加）</span></p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 69.86%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; border-right: solid #ffffff 1.5pt; padding: .75pt 7.5pt .75pt 7.5pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;\">\n          <p class=\"tablecell\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">允许用户创建条目实例</span></p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\">要输入访问值：</p>\n  <ol>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">注意 <strong>动作（Actions）</strong>字段旁边的下拉框。您可以选择<strong>选取关联项（Pick Related）</strong>或<strong>创建关联项（Create Related）</strong>。选择\"选取关联项\"将弹出身份组搜索对话框。选择\"创建关联项\"可创建新的身份组。本示例使用\"选取关联项\"选项。</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Figure_indented\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/aras-images/searchid.png\"></p>\n  <ol start=\"2\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">从列表中选择一个身份组，然后单击绿色箭头将其添加到\"访问\"（Access）选项卡。所选身份组将出现在权限条目的\"访问\"选项卡中。通过勾选相应权限的复选框，选择您希望该身份组拥有的权限。</li>\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">如果您从下拉框中选择了\"创建关联项\"（Create Related），将为您创建一个新的空行。您可以输入新身份组的名称（即时创建），并添加您希望该新身份组拥有的权限。</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"listindent1\" style=\"margin-left: 1.0in; text-indent: -.25in;\"><br>\n    <img src=\"/aras-images/mp2.jpg\"></p>\n  <ol start=\"4\">\n    <li class=\"Numbered\">保存、解锁并关闭权限。</li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">您可以设置一个权限来为多个不同的身份组授予不同的权限。请记住，身份组可以是组和个人，如果一个个人身份组包含在多个组身份组中，其权限是累积的。</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionfirst\">要将权限连接到 ItemType（物料类型）：</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionlist\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; text-indent: -.25in;\">1.<span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">     </span> 从目录（TOC）中，<span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">管理（Administration）</span></span>，选择<span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">ItemType（物料类型）</span></span>并找到您要分配权限的 ItemType。</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionlist\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; text-indent: -.25in;\">2.<span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">     </span> 打开 ItemType 进行编辑，并选择<span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">权限（Permissions）</span></span>选项卡。</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionlist\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; text-indent: -.25in;\">3.<span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">     </span> 如果您已经创建了权限，请单击\"选择条目\"按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/selitems.jpg\">，从出现的权限对话框中选择相应的权限，然后单击\"返回所选\"图标 <img src=\"/aras-images/returnselect.jpg\">。</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionlist\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; text-indent: -.25in;\">4.<span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">    </span>如果您尚未创建权限，可以通过选择<span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">创建条目（Create Item）</span></span> <span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">图标 <img src=\"/aras-images/createitem.jpg\"> 在\"权限\"选项卡上</span></span><span class=\"menuchoice\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-weight: normal;\">即时创建。</span></span> 系统将引导您完成<a href=\"#CreatePermissions\">前面概述的</a>相同步骤，但权限将已经分配给 ItemType。</p>\n  <p class=\"instructionlist\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; text-indent: -.25in;\">6.<span style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">     </span> <span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">单击 <img src=\"/aras-images/done.jpg\"> 保存</span> ItemType。</p>\n  \n  \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Permissions/creating_a_permission.htm"
}